{
 "encounter_id": "00916",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hello doctor! I'm Mrs Okafor's friend, I drive her to appointments. She says she's got something stuck in her throat, and it's been bothering her for weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for bringing her. Mrs Okafor, can you describe it for me?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It feels like a lump, right in the middle, here. Even when I haven't eaten."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did you first notice it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She told me at book club, and that was in the spring."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it get worse when you swallow food or drinks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it's actually better when I eat. It's there when I swallow my saliva."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss, hoarseness, or coughing up blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No weight loss. My voice is the same. No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any heartburn or a sour taste?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes, yes. A burning after dinner."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And a thyroid tablet, levothyroxine, 100 micrograms."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, underactive thyroid, and I'm a bit anxious, I admit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She's been worried it's something terrible. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's understandable. Do you smoke or drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No smoking. A glass of wine now and then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your pulse, pressure, temperature and oxygen. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 130 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good. Now let me feel your neck and look at your throat. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 16.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your throat looks normal, there's no lump in the neck, and your thyroid isn't enlarged. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So there's nothing there? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing I can see. What you describe is a feeling called globus, which is common and usually harmless, and acid reflux can be involved."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that a relief or not? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is a relief, mostly. I'd like to arrange a blood test for your thyroid and a check of your iron levels, just to be thorough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Try smaller meals, avoid late dinners, and cut down on strong coffee and spicy food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll make sure she keeps to that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me see you in four weeks, and we'll talk again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
